{"version": 1, "updated_at": "2026-10-21T10:14:01Z", "items": [{"id": "feed-c62180088501", "title": "对冲基金减持科技股，Mag 7持仓却创历史新高！高盛：市场处处创纪录，唯独缺乏信心", "source": "华尔街见闻", "author": "", "url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783421", "image_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/45b40581-8a86-45e7-8dc7-629023547f05.jpeg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Finance", "topic": "zh_money", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Finance", "text", "zh", "zh_money", "华尔街见闻", "投资", "社会话题", "科技"], "excerpt": "标普屡创新高之际，市场内部正在发生截然相反的事情。对冲基金一边抛售科技股，一边将\"Mag", "published_at": "2026-10-12T06:49:27Z", "curated_at": "2026-10-12T10:13:13Z", "body": "bodies/feed-c62180088501.json", "engagement": 170, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-7d725992ce73", "title": "AI运动硬件公司获数亿B轮融资，用体育大模型重构网球自主训练体验｜硬氪首发", "source": "36氪", "author": "", "url": "https://36kr.com/p/3990015565708035?f=rss", "image_url": "https://img.36krcdn.com/hsossms/20261010/v2_7c5ece83ab0e418ebd1bedfe5f501f43@6022551_oswg1497999oswg1500oswg1049_img_png?x-oss-process=image/quality,q_90/format,jpg/interlace,1", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["36氪", "Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "健身", "科技", "网球"], "excerpt": "作者｜黄楠\n\n\n编辑｜袁斯来\n\n\n硬氪获悉，AI体育硬件公司「庞伯特」近日完成数亿元B轮融资，由上海国投先导基金领投，元禾璞华、浦东创投等跟投，老股东蓝驰创投持续加注。高鹄资本担任独家财务顾问。\n\n\n此前公司已连续完成三轮A轮系列融资，神骐资本、明势创投、蓝驰创投、锦秋基金、华创资本及成为资本等头部机构集体参与。\n\n\n", "published_at": "2026-10-11T10:10:43Z", "curated_at": "2026-10-11T10:12:12Z", "body": "bodies/feed-7d725992ce73.json", "engagement": 170, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-f284d9125b3f", "title": "传折叠屏 iPhone 维修费 8000 元，苹果：价格未公布；腾讯 Chatterfly 输入法开启内测；软高管：AI 训练是「人类历史上最大规模的劳动盗窃」｜极客早知道", "source": "极客公园", "author": "", "url": "http://www.geekpark.net/news/370608", "image_url": "https://imgslim.geekpark.net/uploads/image/file/97/17/9717c